<title>FRANCE: French production bottlenecks remain low - survey.</title>
<headline>French production bottlenecks remain low - survey.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>French production bottlenecks are expected to remain low in the fourth quarter of 1996, national statistics institute INSEE said in its quarterly survey of business leaders.</p>
<p>It gave the following data on percentages of companies reporting production bottlenecks:</p>
<p>					1996		1995</p>
<p>			   Oct Jul  Apr   Jan Oct Jul Apr   Jan</p>
<p> Industry overall     15  14   15    13  19  29  25    23</p>
<p> Manufacturing	  12  12   11    13  17  30  30    26</p>
<p> Agri-business	  12   9    9     9   9   8   5    14</p>
<p> Semi-finished goods  16  15   14    17  22  39  35    30</p>
<p> Capital goods	  12  14    9    10  14  15  13    19</p>
<p> Cars, land transport  3   4    8    10  10  49  49    42</p>
<p> Consumer goods	 14  12   10    12  20  22  27    19</p>
<p> Energy		   59  59   89    30  63  66   2     2</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5381</p>
